                <div><strong class="text-[#0B1E48]">full_name</strong>: Candidate name as per Aadhaar</div>
                <div><strong class="text-[#0B1E48]">program</strong>: B.Tech Computer Science | B.Tech Electronics &amp; Comm. | B.Tech Mechanical Engg</div>
                <div><strong class="text-[#0B1E48]">admission_quota</strong>: APPROVED_INTAKE | SUPERNUMERARY | NRI | OCI | FN</div>
